  "solution": {
    "text": "Balanced chemical equation is<br/><br/> <math><mover><mrow><mn>6</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> <br/><br/>Hence statements 1, 2 and 4 are correct.",
